/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * ASTEROID.RC - Resource script for the ASTEROID font module.
 *
 * This file is kept for documentation only.  The original shipped with:
 *
 *     FONT 100 small.fnt
 *     FONT 200 large.fnt
 *
 * Open Watcom's wrc cannot compile GPI font resources: its OS/2 FONT path
 * prepends a 118-byte Windows FontInfo header to the payload (corrupting
 * FAT fonts) and hard-fails on .fnt input with "Error! 16: Unexpected end
 * of file".  The bundled resources are therefore generated into
 * ASTEROID.RES (FONTDIRECTORY type 6/name 1; faces type 1000/names 100
 * and 200) by fontdll_res.py and bound into the DLL at build time.  See
 * the README for the generation recipe.
 *------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

FONT 100 small.fnt
FONT 200 large.fnt